# Keep the build context small: the Dockerfile is invoked with the repository
# root as the context, and media/runtime directories can hold tens of GB.
# 构建上下文为仓库根目录，媒体与运行时目录可能有几十 GB，必须排除。

# Version control and CI / 版本控制与 CI
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.codex-screenshots

# Local secrets and runtime state / 本地密钥与运行时数据
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Bind-mounted host directories / 与容器绑定的宿主机目录
music
source-music
data
postgres

# Documentation and tooling / 文档与辅助脚本
docs
logo
scripts
design
sample-music

# Build outputs and dependencies / 构建产物与依赖
android-tv
backend/target
backend/data
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.vite
.gradle

*.log
.DS_Store

# TV APKs must stay in the context: the Dockerfile copies them into the image.
# TV APK 需要保留：Dockerfile 会把它们复制进镜像。
!dist/tv-apk/*.apk
